<title>USA: NAL Financial stake held by Bay Pond group.</title>
<headline>NAL Financial stake held by Bay Pond group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group including Bay Pond Partners L.P. said Thursday it has acquired a 5.65 percent stake or 522,400 common shares in NAL Financial Group Inc.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the Boston-based group said it paid $3.9 million for the stake and holds it for investment.</p>
<p>NAL is an automobile financing company based in Fort Lauderdale, Fla.</p>
